1
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:38,970
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,509 --> 00:01:41,750
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:42,570
[Yu Changxuan, the New
Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Yu Army,]

4
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,470
[Had a Secret Talk with Kurata Ichiro
the Colonel General of the Japanese Army]

5
00:01:44,650 --> 00:01:46,640
Why is Fifth Young Master Yu
getting so close

6
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,370
to the Japanese all of a sudden?

7
00:01:49,979 --> 00:01:52,360
Nowadays, almost all warlords are

8
00:01:52,539 --> 00:01:54,390
colluding with foreign powers.

9
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,840
Raising an army needs money, right?

10
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,240
Going to battle requires
firearms and ammunition, right?

11
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,560
Everything in this world

12
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,980
can be concluded as a big business.

13
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:03,260
Doesn't that make him

14
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,610
like the President,

15
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,890
despised and cursed

16
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,950
by everyone for the rest of his life?

17
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:08,860
Shut up.

18
00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:13,500
You've got no proof,

19
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,170
yet you're talking nonsense

20
00:02:15,170 --> 00:02:16,300
and gossiping here?

21
00:02:16,810 --> 00:02:18,720
It's already in the newspapers.

22
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,290
The whole city is talking about it.

23
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:21,430
Why can't we?

24
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,210
Did you see it with your own eyes

25
00:02:24,210 --> 00:02:25,810
or hear it with your own ears?

26
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:28,470
This is
Fifth Young Master Yu's Xiangxi Hotel.

27
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,400
Every one of us

28
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,730
is making a living here.

29
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,800
If anyone dares to slander
Fifth Young Master Yu again,

30
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,130
I'll request Master Jin

31
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,530
to kick them out

32
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:38,000
without exception.

33
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:46,720
[Xing Newspaper]

34
00:02:52,829 --> 00:02:58,860
[Nanhuai]

35
00:03:07,850 --> 00:03:09,040
Who is this big shot?

36
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:12,020
It's said to be Military Governor Chu,
a higher-up.

37
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:15,060
-Step back!
-Back! Back!

38
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,900
[Nanhai Military General
Staff Department]

39
00:03:22,579 --> 00:03:24,630
Down with imperialism!

40
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,530
Down with imperialism!

41
00:03:29,590 --> 00:03:30,960
Down with the traitor!

42
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:35,340
Down with imperialism!

43
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:40,070
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

44
00:03:44,610 --> 00:03:51,160
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

45
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:46,530
It's been years,

46
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:47,870
yet the layout of your office

47
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:49,620
hasn't changed a bit.

48
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:51,340
Seeing these things

49
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,460
brings back so many memories.

50
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:56,400
You wrote these words—loyalty,

51
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,190
filial piety, and integrity for me.

52
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:01,400
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

53
00:03:58,410 --> 00:04:00,080
I've engraved them in my mind

54
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,920
and dare not forget them.

55
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:03,870
We of the older generation

56
00:04:04,410 --> 00:04:06,680
know honor and integrity.

57
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:11,460
We won't collude

58
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:12,400
with dangerous enemies

59
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,780
just for some personal interests,

60
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:16,500
let alone be disloyal and unrighteous.

61
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,800
Today's youngsters

62
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:28,760
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

63
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,750
are really unruly.

64
00:04:30,690 --> 00:04:32,020
Military Governor Chu.

65
00:04:32,890 --> 00:04:34,450
If you trust me,

66
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,300
I hope you'll trust Changxuan, too.

67
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:42,630
A father knows his son best.

68
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,950
This boy will never do anything to harm

69
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:49,510
the great cause of the country.

70
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:53,070
It's not about
whether I believe it or not.

71
00:04:54,810 --> 00:04:56,159
But I must give the authority

72
00:04:56,159 --> 00:04:57,490
an explanation.

73
00:04:58,130 --> 00:05:04,700
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

74
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:02,040
So today, I must

75
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,860
take Changxuan away

76
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:06,100
to the Sujing Military Court

77
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:08,000
for a public trial.

78
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,190
We'll see if he

79
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:11,540
really has

80
00:05:11,540 --> 00:05:13,930
any intention of treason.

81
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:37,450
Changxuan. Changxuan!

82
00:05:38,130 --> 00:05:39,590
You absolutely cannot go.

83
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:41,300
On your way there,

84
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:44,380
if Chu Wenfu has already decided
to kill you,

85
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:46,300
who could possibly stop him?

86
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:53,510
Changxuan!

87
00:05:57,630 --> 00:05:58,680
Down with the traitor!

88
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,890
Down with imperialism!

89
00:05:59,890 --> 00:06:01,240
Down with the traitor!

90
00:06:01,450 --> 00:06:03,370
Down with imperialism!

91
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,660
Down with the traitor!

92
00:06:04,660 --> 00:06:07,320
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

93
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:09,130
How rude of you.

94
00:06:10,250 --> 00:06:11,770
How can you handcuff

95
00:06:12,060 --> 00:06:13,620
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu?

96
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:16,550
Military Governor,
we are just following the rules.

97
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:22,340
Deputy Commander Yu,
my apologies for any offense.

98
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:25,480
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

99
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,540
-Down with imperialism!
-Down with imperialism!

100
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,620
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

101
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:31,690
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

102
00:06:31,690 --> 00:06:33,620
-Please.
-Down with imperialism!

103
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,800
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

104
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,600
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

105
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,920
-Down with imperialism!
-Down with imperialism!

106
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,290
-Down with the traitor!
-Down with the traitor!

107
00:06:42,290 --> 00:06:43,920
Down with the traitor!

108
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,930
-Down with imperialism!
-Down with imperialism!

109
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:47,780
Down with the traitor!

110
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:50,020
Down with the traitor!

111
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:52,190
Down with the traitor!

112
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,070
Yu Changxuan.

113
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:00,870
Yu Changxuan!

114
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,010
Down with the traitor!

115
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:11,540
Yu Changxuan!

116
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,100
Yu Changxuan!

117
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,250
Yu Changxuan!

118
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:26,180
Stay back! Get out!

119
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,060
No entry!

120
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,010
No entry! Stay back!

121
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,420
Down with the traitor!

122
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,010
Down with the traitor!

123
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,070
Yu Changxuan!

124
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,550
Yu Changxuan.

125
00:07:38,450 --> 00:07:39,250
Yu Changxuan!

126
00:07:41,510 --> 00:07:42,170
Stop there!

127
00:07:42,690 --> 00:07:43,630
Don't touch her!

128
00:07:53,810 --> 00:07:54,800
Yu Changxuan.

129
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,330
What are you doing here?

130
00:07:58,810 --> 00:08:00,010
I don't believe

131
00:08:00,030 --> 00:08:02,090
you would collude with the Japanese.

132
00:08:02,610 --> 00:08:03,950
Who are you?

133
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,660
How dare you hinder

134
00:08:05,890 --> 00:08:07,480
the execution of official duties

135
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,280
outside the army headquarters?

136
00:08:13,010 --> 00:08:14,620
You shouldn't be here.

137
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:17,070
I know you had dinner

138
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:18,690
with the Japanese because of me.

139
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:19,450
I don't believe

140
00:08:19,450 --> 00:08:20,270
you would compromise

141
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:21,220
your principles for this.

142
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:22,480
Don't be so confident.

143
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,700
You think you know me well?

144
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:27,560
Boren!

145
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:28,270
Yes, sir!

146
00:08:28,450 --> 00:08:29,250
Take her away.

147
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:32,830
Yu Changxuan.

148
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:33,860
Come on, let's go.

149
00:08:35,250 --> 00:08:35,909
Let go of me!

150
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:37,750
Everyone,

151
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,330
after the battle in Luanjiang,

152
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,549
quite a lot of local armies

153
00:08:41,549 --> 00:08:43,010
wanted to join the Yu Army.

154
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,120
But Fifth Young Master Yu

155
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,580
has laid down clear rules—

156
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:46,720
no opening railways

157
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:48,410
and ports to the Japanese,

158
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,840
no selling weapons

159
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,720
or minerals to the Japanese,

160
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:52,220
no leasing

161
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:53,820
land to the Japanese.

162
00:08:54,250 --> 00:08:55,410
These 3 rules were

163
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:57,460
all published in the newspapers.

164
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,390
[Down with Japanese Imperialism!]

165
00:08:57,830 --> 00:08:59,500
I work at the Xiangxi Hotel.

166
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,470
I've seen the Japanese approach

167
00:09:01,470 --> 00:09:03,760
Fifth Young Master Yu
for cooperation several times,

168
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,450
but he rejected them all.

169
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:07,200
If he really wanted

170
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,240
to collude with the Japanese,

171
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,900
why would he wait until today?

172
00:09:32,770 --> 00:09:33,630
Ye Pingjun,

173
00:09:35,290 --> 00:09:36,480
you're an outsider.

174
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:39,380
What right do you have
to interfere in my affairs?

175
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:44,370
Yes,

176
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:46,820
I am an outsider.

177
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:50,940
Commander Yu,

178
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,420
even I, an outsider,

179
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:54,390
know that

180
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:55,290
Fifth Young Master Yu

181
00:09:55,290 --> 00:09:56,460
would never do this.

182
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:59,550
As his father,

183
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:01,860
don't you know him better than I do?

184
00:10:02,250 --> 00:10:04,710
Don't you know his character
and ambitions?

185
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,030
Zhongquan,

186
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:19,630
are you just going to let a little girl

187
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:20,790
mess around here?

188
00:10:28,220 --> 00:10:28,980
Boren!

189
00:10:30,130 --> 00:10:30,940
Take her away.

190
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,000
Hurry...

191
00:10:33,220 --> 00:10:33,940
What are you doing?

192
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:35,000
Let's go, let's go.

193
00:10:36,690 --> 00:10:38,150
Hear me out first.

194
00:10:38,150 --> 00:10:38,910
What's the rush? Come on.

195
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,080
Deputy Commander Yu,

196
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,470
we can't delay any longer.

197
00:10:41,470 --> 00:10:42,270
Get in the car.

198
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:44,280
No, don't go!

199
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:46,000
Don't go! Just look!

200
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:00,030
Wait.

201
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,650
Military Governor Chu.

202
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:13,360
Changxuan can't go with you.

203
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,550
What do you mean?

204
00:11:19,770 --> 00:11:20,770
Since this matter

205
00:11:20,770 --> 00:11:22,630
happened in Nanhuai,

206
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:25,650
It's only right

207
00:11:25,650 --> 00:11:26,600
to get to the bottom

208
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,790
of it in Nanhuai.

209
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:30,630
Do you agree?

210
00:11:40,010 --> 00:11:40,820
Zhongquan,

211
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,050
you'd better

212
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:45,000
think this through.

213
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:47,870
Military Governor,

214
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,940
Changxuan is my only son

215
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:54,220
and the future commander-in-chief

216
00:11:54,220 --> 00:11:55,340
of the Yu Army.

217
00:11:57,110 --> 00:11:58,150
As his father,

218
00:11:58,790 --> 00:11:59,960
I cannot

219
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,200
risk anything happening to him.

220
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:05,900
If he is to face a court-martial,

221
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,890
I should be the one to escort him there.

222
00:12:10,010 --> 00:12:11,120
If he is guilty,

223
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:13,410
I should also

224
00:12:13,410 --> 00:12:16,050
stand in the dock beside him.

225
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:29,500
Yu Zhongquan,

226
00:12:31,050 --> 00:12:33,650
you are openly disobeying orders!

227
00:12:37,750 --> 00:12:38,810
What are you doing?

228
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:07,170
Commander-in-Chief!

229
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,020
Commander,

230
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,620
please review the documents.

231
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:21,850
[Archive]

232
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:22,240
Actually, Fifth Young Master Yu

233
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:22,770
knew Takahashi

234
00:13:22,770 --> 00:13:23,870
and Kurata Ichiro's true purpose

235
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:25,270
from the very beginning.

236
00:13:28,930 --> 00:13:29,710
Takahashi

237
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:31,510
claims to transport cotton for spinning,

238
00:13:31,510 --> 00:13:32,050
but in reality,

239
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:33,840
he's trying to smuggle tungsten
back to Japan.

240
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:34,550
How dare

241
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:35,410
they smuggle

242
00:13:35,410 --> 00:13:36,670
right under our noses?

243
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:39,650
That's all the more reason
for me to cooperate with them.

244
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:40,500
For what?

245
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:44,120
Only by pretending to cooperate with them

246
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,840
can we swap

247
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,190
this batch of tungsten

248
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:48,360
before their freighter leaves the port

249
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,290
and stop them

250
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:51,360
from delivering the raw materials for guns

251
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,290
back to Japan.

252
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:53,950
Changxuan,

253
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,360
this is extremely risky.

254
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:57,790
What if word gets out that we are

255
00:13:57,790 --> 00:13:59,590
trading with the Japanese army?

256
00:14:00,890 --> 00:14:02,040
Despite its risk,

257
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:03,790
we must do it.

258
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,550
We absolutely can't let the Japanese

259
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:07,010
smuggle our raw materials

260
00:14:07,290 --> 00:14:08,500
to make guns.

261
00:14:09,250 --> 00:14:09,910
Commander,

262
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:10,630
Governor,

263
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,460
we have seized the tungsten.

264
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:14,700
It is stored
in the Nanhuai Port's warehouse,

265
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:16,560
ready for inspection at any time.

266
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:23,170
He really is innocent.

267
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:45,000
Changxuan,

268
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,950
if that's the case,

269
00:14:47,290 --> 00:14:49,150
why didn't you tell us so earlier?

270
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:52,330
I didn't want to alert the enemy.

271
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,540
Before the seizure of tungsten,

272
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:57,030
there couldn't be the slightest slip-up.

273
00:15:01,070 --> 00:15:02,140
Mr. Chu,

274
00:15:02,230 --> 00:15:04,500
you specifically made a trip here
for nothing.

275
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:05,760
Please don't blame me.

276
00:15:11,390 --> 00:15:13,820
You did this for the greater good
of the nation.

277
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:16,150
How could I possibly blame you?

278
00:15:19,610 --> 00:15:21,410
Come on, say thank you to Mr. Chu.

279
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:24,230
Thank you, Mr. Chu!

280
00:15:26,710 --> 00:15:28,510
Military Governor, you've gone

281
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:29,910
to so much trouble

282
00:15:30,770 --> 00:15:32,410
coming all the way here for this matter.

283
00:15:32,410 --> 00:15:33,870
Thank you for your effort.

284
00:15:34,390 --> 00:15:36,460
Would you like to stay a few more days

285
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:38,390
and join me for a few drinks?

286
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:39,340
No, thanks.

287
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:42,410
I still need to go to Sujing

288
00:15:42,750 --> 00:15:45,010
to report this matter to the higher-ups.

289
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:46,240
Understood.

290
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:47,340
Let's take a rain check?

291
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:47,840
Sure.

292
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:48,390
Deal?

293
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:48,960
Deal.

294
00:15:49,050 --> 00:15:49,440
Nice.

295
00:16:12,750 --> 00:16:13,440
Alright,

296
00:16:15,250 --> 00:16:16,110
go do your work.

297
00:17:05,050 --> 00:17:06,430
I'm Zhou Tai from Yu's Residence.

298
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:08,960
Is there any news
about Fifth Young Master Yu?

299
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,220
Please continue to look for him.

300
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,089
Madam,

301
00:17:16,329 --> 00:17:17,859
there are still no updates.

302
00:17:20,849 --> 00:17:21,530
Seems like

303
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:24,640
I have to go to the army myself.

304
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,460
-Mom.
-Mom, calm down.

305
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:27,270
The situation

306
00:17:27,270 --> 00:17:28,510
still remains unclear now.

307
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:30,960
What else do you need to know
about the situation?

308
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:31,940
Chu Wenfu has already

309
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:33,380
gone to the army
to demand they hand him over.

310
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:34,400
He came prepared,

311
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,920
with an aggressive approach.

312
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,110
I can't just sit back

313
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:39,240
and watch him take my son away

314
00:17:39,810 --> 00:17:42,290
without doing anything!

315
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,720
-Mom, Mom.
-Mom.

316
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:44,610
You can't go, Mom.

317
00:17:44,610 --> 00:17:45,700
Say no more!

318
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,850
Get the car ready.

319
00:17:46,850 --> 00:17:47,690
Yes, Madam.

320
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:50,880
Mom.

321
00:17:53,530 --> 00:17:55,060
You're back, Young Master.

322
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:58,570
The Young Master is back!

323
00:17:58,570 --> 00:17:59,450
Changxuan?

324
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:00,140
Mom.

325
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:02,310
You're finally back.

326
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:04,290
Did you get hurt?

327
00:18:05,570 --> 00:18:06,260
Mom,

328
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,310
I'm fine.

329
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,200
Changxuan, you have no idea.

330
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,350
Mom's been worrying about you

331
00:18:10,350 --> 00:18:12,350
and hasn't slept properly for days.

332
00:18:13,500 --> 00:18:15,720
I had the kitchen
stew some tonic soup for you.

333
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,510
Go take a bath,

334
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:18,640
get changed, and then come to drink it.

335
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:21,700
Sorry for making you worry, Mom.

336
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,720
I'll go, then.

337
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:25,680
Go ahead.

338
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:28,440
Young Master, this way.

339
00:18:30,220 --> 00:18:31,110
Feel easy now?

340
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,310
He's finally back.

341
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,500
Don't touch her!

342
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:19,920
You shouldn't be here.

343
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,290
Boren!

344
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:22,850
Yes, sir!

345
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,800
Take her away.

346
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:26,580
Come on, let's go.

347
00:19:54,810 --> 00:19:57,140
Mom, I'm heading out to get your medicine.

348
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,600
Don't be out too late.

349
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,540
Why did you help me today?

350
00:20:32,850 --> 00:20:33,750
You risked your life

351
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:35,280
to save me and my mom before.

352
00:20:35,610 --> 00:20:36,660
No matter what,

353
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:37,920
I couldn't just stand by and watch.

354
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,580
That's not what I want to hear.

355
00:20:44,750 --> 00:20:46,420
But that's all I have to say.

356
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:54,460
Yu Changxuan,

357
00:20:54,770 --> 00:20:56,500
what are you doing? Let me go.

358
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:03,180
I want to hear you say

359
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:06,770
that you have feelings for me.

360
00:21:11,050 --> 00:21:11,740
Just say it.

361
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:17,450
Say that you have feelings for me.

362
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:26,210
Mr. Yu,

363
00:21:27,210 --> 00:21:29,670
I just wanted
to express my gratitude to you.

364
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,770
There was nothing more to it.

365
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,060
Is it fun fooling me like this?

366
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,420
Seeing me swallow my pride and beg you,

367
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:54,750
do you feel pretty smug?

368
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,270
I told you ages ago—

369
00:22:00,660 --> 00:22:01,720
if you have no feelings for me,

370
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:04,050
then disappear from my world completely.

371
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:05,330
How could you come

372
00:22:05,330 --> 00:22:06,330
and help me today?

373
00:22:11,310 --> 00:22:12,050
Ye Pingjun.

374
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:18,300
How can you torture me like this?

375
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:19,960
I don't get it.

376
00:23:28,260 --> 00:23:29,460
I really don't get it.

377
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:26,140
[Fuxingde Famous Tea]

378
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:37,100
I just want to hear you say it.

379
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:40,060
Just say it.

380
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,740
Say that you have feelings for me.

381
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,750
You've obviously taken things

382
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:09,030
out of context in this article.

383
00:25:09,030 --> 00:25:10,070
I gave you the photo

384
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:11,730
not for you to twist the facts!

385
00:25:12,460 --> 00:25:13,920
Yu Changxuan is a warlord.

386
00:25:15,530 --> 00:25:17,130
Warlords like him always use

387
00:25:17,330 --> 00:25:19,420
their armies to consolidate their power.

388
00:25:19,420 --> 00:25:20,880
They're greedy and cruel.

389
00:25:21,270 --> 00:25:22,000
He is the first target

390
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,200
we need to eliminate.

391
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:24,710
Should we still

392
00:25:25,090 --> 00:25:26,680
stick to morality and rules

393
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:28,500
when dealing with people like him?

394
00:25:28,500 --> 00:25:29,960
But that doesn't justify
twisting the truth

395
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:31,020
or framing people!

396
00:25:32,090 --> 00:25:32,850
This goes against

397
00:25:32,850 --> 00:25:34,770
the original purpose of our paper!

398
00:25:34,770 --> 00:25:36,830
We're seeking the truth,

399
00:25:37,090 --> 00:25:38,660
not fabrication!

400
00:25:39,050 --> 00:25:40,580
That depends on the target.

401
00:25:42,050 --> 00:25:43,380
There was nothing wrong

402
00:25:44,460 --> 00:25:46,060
with the way we handled this.

403
00:25:49,590 --> 00:25:51,150
There's no point in arguing about it now.

404
00:25:51,150 --> 00:25:52,060
But I will not

405
00:25:52,540 --> 00:25:54,060
allow you to do this again.

406
00:26:00,110 --> 00:26:00,740
Pingjun.

407
00:26:14,820 --> 00:26:16,150
What are you doing here?

408
00:26:17,420 --> 00:26:18,810
I can't believe

409
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,740
it was you who used the photo

410
00:26:21,740 --> 00:26:23,270
to frame Yu Changxuan.

411
00:26:25,530 --> 00:26:27,140
Why are you so worked up?

412
00:26:30,590 --> 00:26:32,050
You were very brave today.

413
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:33,770
You went alone

414
00:26:33,770 --> 00:26:35,370
to the Yu Army headquarters,

415
00:26:36,070 --> 00:26:37,610
defending Yu Changxuan

416
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,810
and clearing his name.

417
00:26:41,180 --> 00:26:41,660
Yes.

418
00:26:44,420 --> 00:26:45,220
I did it.

419
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:49,900
What do you mean by that?

420
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:53,550
Nothing.

421
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,440
That's right.

422
00:26:57,940 --> 00:26:58,610
After all, the two of you...

423
00:26:58,610 --> 00:26:59,720
The two of us?

424
00:27:02,420 --> 00:27:03,220
Xueting,

425
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:04,940
I have

426
00:27:04,940 --> 00:27:06,310
explained to you many times

427
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:07,380
that nothing ever happened

428
00:27:07,380 --> 00:27:09,240
between Yu Changxuan and me.

429
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,240
Pingjun,

430
00:27:15,660 --> 00:27:17,190
I have no right to blame you,

431
00:27:18,270 --> 00:27:19,330
because I know that

432
00:27:19,830 --> 00:27:20,500
you did all this

433
00:27:20,500 --> 00:27:21,530
for me, and you were

434
00:27:21,530 --> 00:27:22,510
forced to play along with him.

435
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:24,220
But listen, for Yu Changxuan,

436
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,440
no matter what I have to do,

437
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:28,240
even if it

438
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:28,960
disgusts you,

439
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:30,690
I will make sure he goes to hell.

440
00:27:33,570 --> 00:27:34,550
But that's

441
00:27:34,550 --> 00:27:35,810
in the past.

442
00:27:37,070 --> 00:27:37,850
I don't want it

443
00:27:37,850 --> 00:27:38,850
to be stuck in your heart

444
00:27:38,850 --> 00:27:40,220
like a thorn!

445
00:27:41,070 --> 00:27:42,420
It has made you lose your mind,

446
00:27:42,420 --> 00:27:43,310
Jiang Xueting!

447
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:54,200
Are you worried about me losing my mind,

448
00:27:55,660 --> 00:27:56,350
or are you worried

449
00:27:56,350 --> 00:27:57,420
that I will deal

450
00:27:57,420 --> 00:27:59,150
with Yu Changxuan by all means?

451
00:28:25,140 --> 00:28:25,940
Xueting.

452
00:28:30,310 --> 00:28:32,010
If there's no trust

453
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:35,440
left between us

454
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:36,640
at all,

455
00:28:39,770 --> 00:28:40,770
what's the point

456
00:28:40,770 --> 00:28:42,090
of us being together?

457
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:49,030
Hands off me!

458
00:29:10,850 --> 00:29:13,670
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

459
00:29:27,810 --> 00:29:29,610
What on earth are you looking at?

460
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,220
I'm looking at Fifth Young Master Yu.

461
00:29:32,220 --> 00:29:33,080
Think about it.

462
00:29:33,660 --> 00:29:34,810
He's waited so long for this,

463
00:29:34,810 --> 00:29:36,010
and Ye Pingjun finally

464
00:29:36,010 --> 00:29:37,220
risked her life to save him.

465
00:29:37,220 --> 00:29:38,460
How could he not be excited?

466
00:29:38,460 --> 00:29:40,350
How could he not have expectations?

467
00:29:40,350 --> 00:29:41,180
What a pity.

468
00:29:41,310 --> 00:29:42,460
The two of them are

469
00:29:42,460 --> 00:29:43,610
both so stubborn.

470
00:29:43,660 --> 00:29:45,120
Why are they so obstinate?

471
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:47,630
All they need now is a little help

472
00:29:47,650 --> 00:29:48,540
from Cupid,

473
00:29:48,570 --> 00:29:49,970
and they'll be together.

474
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,220
That's all you've been

475
00:29:53,810 --> 00:29:55,160
thinking about the whole morning?

476
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,090
Oh, my goodness.

477
00:29:56,100 --> 00:29:58,030
This is what really matters, okay?

478
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:59,020
You blockhead.

479
00:29:59,180 --> 00:30:00,220
It's a waste of time

480
00:30:00,220 --> 00:30:01,680
talking to you about this.

481
00:30:01,750 --> 00:30:02,550
Tell you what,

482
00:30:03,770 --> 00:30:05,770
Fifth Young Master Yu's ship of love

483
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:08,240
still needs me to keep it from sinking.

484
00:30:10,290 --> 00:30:11,200
Bro,

485
00:30:12,500 --> 00:30:13,310
wish me luck.

486
00:30:40,050 --> 00:30:42,050
Boren, are you asking for a beating?

487
00:30:44,310 --> 00:30:45,310
Here's the thing.

488
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:46,740
This year,

489
00:30:47,140 --> 00:30:48,850
the maple leaves at Baidu Bridge

490
00:30:48,850 --> 00:30:50,110
have turned red again.

491
00:30:50,350 --> 00:30:51,940
Don't you want to go

492
00:30:51,940 --> 00:30:53,510
take a look?

493
00:30:53,510 --> 00:30:54,640
I'm not interested.

494
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,160
Yeah,

495
00:30:56,510 --> 00:30:59,720
as they say, a lovely view is best enjoyed
with a beautiful lady.

496
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:00,660
How about

497
00:31:00,750 --> 00:31:02,570
you go together with Miss Ye

498
00:31:02,570 --> 00:31:04,070
to enjoy the view?

499
00:31:06,090 --> 00:31:07,510
How many times do I have to tell you?

500
00:31:07,510 --> 00:31:09,310
Don't bring her up in front of me.

501
00:31:10,740 --> 00:31:12,160
It's one rule for you

502
00:31:12,160 --> 00:31:13,890
and another for everyone else.

503
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:17,400
Be honest with yourself—

504
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,050
have you ever

505
00:31:18,050 --> 00:31:19,850
truly let go when it comes to her?

506
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,850
I've completely let it go this time.

507
00:31:23,850 --> 00:31:25,250
You simply can't do it!

508
00:31:25,810 --> 00:31:26,570
Look, you two

509
00:31:26,570 --> 00:31:27,570
have risked your lives

510
00:31:27,570 --> 00:31:28,550
saving each other.

511
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:30,110
Since you've already
entrusted your lives to each other,

512
00:31:30,110 --> 00:31:31,180
I just don't understand why

513
00:31:31,180 --> 00:31:32,640
you two can't be together!

514
00:31:34,570 --> 00:31:35,770
From the day I met you,

515
00:31:36,010 --> 00:31:37,720
I knew you were a man with great vision,

516
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:38,790
never dithering

517
00:31:38,790 --> 00:31:40,320
or leaving things hanging.

518
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,510
I don't believe you're

519
00:31:42,510 --> 00:31:43,710
too scared to see her.

520
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,580
Let me tell you,

521
00:31:54,790 --> 00:31:56,590
Miss Ye has already agreed to go.

522
00:31:56,740 --> 00:31:57,540
Whether you go

523
00:31:58,090 --> 00:31:59,090
or not is up to you.

524
00:32:19,310 --> 00:32:20,810
Women's drama club?

525
00:32:25,770 --> 00:32:27,530
Well, my distant cousin

526
00:32:28,380 --> 00:32:30,530
is preparing for her debut performance.

527
00:32:30,530 --> 00:32:31,290
But they ran into

528
00:32:31,290 --> 00:32:33,270
a serious script problem
at the last minute.

529
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:35,000
You're quite famous for playwriting,

530
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,460
so I came to you.

531
00:32:37,010 --> 00:32:37,770
I'd better pass.

532
00:32:37,770 --> 00:32:38,310
Wait.

533
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,060
We've known each other

534
00:32:40,060 --> 00:32:40,720
for so long.

535
00:32:40,980 --> 00:32:41,840
No matter what,

536
00:32:42,290 --> 00:32:44,020
you should do me a favor, right?

537
00:32:44,070 --> 00:32:44,880
How about this?

538
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:45,920
Tonight at 7:00, let's meet

539
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:47,480
in the Linyuetai private room
at Taifeng Restaurant.

540
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:47,920
I will

541
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:49,070
send a car to pick you up.

542
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:49,730
It's a deal.

543
00:32:50,180 --> 00:32:50,780
Thank you.

544
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:05,220
[Taifeng Restaurant]

545
00:33:16,140 --> 00:33:17,140
This way, please.

546
00:33:23,510 --> 00:33:24,420
See?

547
00:33:24,660 --> 00:33:26,180
For important matters,

548
00:33:26,270 --> 00:33:28,240
I, Boren, am the really reliable one
to count on.

549
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:29,380
Leave it to someone else,

550
00:33:29,380 --> 00:33:30,710
and it'll be screwed up.

551
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,510
It was Li Boren

552
00:34:02,510 --> 00:34:04,110
who asked me to come and help.

553
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,960
I didn't know you were also here.

554
00:34:07,340 --> 00:34:08,429
I'm leaving right now.

555
00:34:08,429 --> 00:34:09,060
Hold on.

556
00:34:29,010 --> 00:34:30,070
Since you're here,

557
00:34:31,550 --> 00:34:33,150
watch the fireworks with me.

558
00:34:51,190 --> 00:34:52,650
Consider it...

559
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,420
our final farewell.

560
00:35:19,330 --> 00:35:20,310
For a long time,

561
00:35:22,430 --> 00:35:24,890
there were
only 3 things that mattered to me—

562
00:35:25,380 --> 00:35:26,170
the army,

563
00:35:27,160 --> 00:35:28,090
military power,

564
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:30,160
and weapons.

565
00:35:31,890 --> 00:35:33,070
I once said that I'd go from having

566
00:35:33,070 --> 00:35:34,280
not a single soldier

567
00:35:36,210 --> 00:35:38,010
to taking over the entire Yu Army

568
00:35:40,210 --> 00:35:42,070
and marching straight to Sujing.

569
00:35:42,960 --> 00:35:44,750
To achieve this goal,

570
00:35:45,460 --> 00:35:47,060
I would do whatever it takes.

571
00:35:48,500 --> 00:35:49,830
All I ever thought about

572
00:35:51,210 --> 00:35:52,870
was weighing the pros and cons

573
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:55,820
and making trade-offs for benefits.

574
00:35:57,010 --> 00:35:57,610
I always believed

575
00:35:57,610 --> 00:35:59,610
that so-called love was a weakness,

576
00:36:00,050 --> 00:36:01,650
something that held you back

577
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,360
from progressing to success

578
00:36:06,260 --> 00:36:08,320
and made you lose control of yourself

579
00:36:09,050 --> 00:36:10,110
and lose your mind.

580
00:36:12,570 --> 00:36:13,900
But I didn't expect that

581
00:36:15,460 --> 00:36:17,320
you'd become the only exception.

582
00:36:21,130 --> 00:36:23,530
When I heard that
you were getting engaged,

583
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:27,260
I locked you up in Fengtai
against your will.

584
00:36:29,070 --> 00:36:30,170
I told myself that

585
00:36:31,780 --> 00:36:33,380
as long as I kept you by my side

586
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:36,930
and treated you well day after day,

587
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:41,000
you would eventually be moved by me.

588
00:36:43,860 --> 00:36:45,720
But I underestimated your pride.

589
00:36:48,550 --> 00:36:49,360
The moment I saw you

590
00:36:49,360 --> 00:36:51,050
lying in that pool of blood,

591
00:36:54,010 --> 00:36:55,210
I finally understood

592
00:36:57,650 --> 00:36:58,580
that I was wrong.

593
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:07,090
I finally realized that

594
00:37:10,550 --> 00:37:12,610
I couldn't keep you with me after all.

595
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:16,760
I had to let go.

596
00:37:20,650 --> 00:37:22,780
When I was fighting on the front lines,

597
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,670
I wasn't some invincible hero

598
00:37:25,670 --> 00:37:27,180
as everybody said.

599
00:37:31,030 --> 00:37:33,440
I stared death in the face time and again.

600
00:37:34,730 --> 00:37:36,630
What supported me to rise

601
00:37:37,530 --> 00:37:39,690
from the bloody battlefield

602
00:37:44,670 --> 00:37:46,470
was the hope to go back to see you.

603
00:37:55,150 --> 00:37:57,150
After everything that's happened,

604
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:02,090
I have finally seen through it.

605
00:38:05,090 --> 00:38:06,050
You were right.

606
00:38:07,730 --> 00:38:08,490
We are

607
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:09,960
worlds apart,

608
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,620
never meant to truly cross paths.

609
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:18,820
The gap between us

610
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:22,070
can never be bridged.

611
00:38:31,650 --> 00:38:33,210
Sorry, Yu Changxuan.

612
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:37,570
I don't know how to respond

613
00:38:37,570 --> 00:38:38,610
to your feelings.

614
00:38:40,260 --> 00:38:42,300
Ever since we met,

615
00:38:43,550 --> 00:38:44,780
my life has completely

616
00:38:44,780 --> 00:38:46,010
gone off course.

617
00:38:50,030 --> 00:38:52,030
You don't need to feel any pressure.

618
00:38:53,530 --> 00:38:54,920
When the fireworks end,

619
00:38:56,210 --> 00:38:56,920
I will disappear

620
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:58,320
from your world for good.

621
00:39:00,650 --> 00:39:01,260
And then,

622
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:04,690
I won't show up in your world again.

623
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:07,200
And you will no longer

624
00:39:09,650 --> 00:39:10,850
be in my world either.

625
00:39:42,090 --> 00:39:46,210
[Though miles apart,
we share the same falling snow.]

626
00:39:46,210 --> 00:39:50,340
[We may consider it
our way of growing old together.]

627
00:41:27,980 --> 00:41:29,380
I've only been in Tianjin for a few days.

628
00:41:29,380 --> 00:41:30,880
How did this happen?

629
00:41:31,510 --> 00:41:32,400
Yu Changxuan suddenly asked

630
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,210
to cancel the engagement with Ziyi.

631
00:41:34,210 --> 00:41:35,840
She came home and cried all night,

632
00:41:35,840 --> 00:41:37,570
smashing everything in sight.

633
00:41:37,650 --> 00:41:39,510
She hasn't eaten or drunk in days.

634
00:41:39,550 --> 00:41:40,800
She refused to see the doctor

635
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:42,590
and even kicked him out.

636
00:41:42,820 --> 00:41:44,070
I was at my wits' end,

637
00:41:44,110 --> 00:41:45,650
so I called you.

638
00:41:57,500 --> 00:41:58,190
Ziyi.

639
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:03,530
Ziyi,

640
00:42:04,030 --> 00:42:04,860
it's Dad.

641
00:42:29,050 --> 00:42:29,780
Ziyi,

642
00:42:30,630 --> 00:42:31,960
I've heard everything.

643
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:33,280
Don't worry!

644
00:42:33,820 --> 00:42:35,150
I will definitely make the Yu family

645
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:36,550
give you an explanation.

646
00:42:48,420 --> 00:42:49,440
Listen to me

647
00:42:50,300 --> 00:42:51,700
and eat something first.

648
00:42:52,550 --> 00:42:54,150
Have something to eat, Ziyi.

649
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:55,960
You are such a catch.

650
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:57,340
There are plenty of talented young men

651
00:42:57,340 --> 00:42:58,430
for you to pick.

652
00:42:58,570 --> 00:42:59,400
Why waste

653
00:42:59,400 --> 00:43:00,190
your tears

654
00:43:00,190 --> 00:43:01,650
on a heartless man?

655
00:43:02,460 --> 00:43:02,800
Here,

656
00:43:03,110 --> 00:43:03,840
eat something.

657
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:05,360
Eat something, Ziyi.

658
00:43:06,820 --> 00:43:07,610
Dad.

659
00:43:09,020 --> 00:43:10,350
You know what?

660
00:43:12,070 --> 00:43:14,320
I've made such a huge compromise.

661
00:43:15,590 --> 00:43:17,260
I swallowed my pride

662
00:43:18,110 --> 00:43:19,550
and gave up

663
00:43:20,230 --> 00:43:21,980
my dignity and self-respect.

664
00:43:24,820 --> 00:43:27,150
But he still asked to break up with me.

665
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:29,710
Nonsense!

666
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:32,480
Even if you agree,

667
00:43:32,650 --> 00:43:33,910
I still won't allow it.

668
00:43:34,670 --> 00:43:36,200
Yu Changxuan

669
00:43:36,630 --> 00:43:38,470
used us, and then cast you aside,

670
00:43:38,550 --> 00:43:40,210
and humiliated you like this!

671
00:43:40,630 --> 00:43:41,320
I

672
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:43,360
definitely will

673
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:44,760
make him pay for this!

674
00:43:45,820 --> 00:43:46,730
Ziyi,

675
00:43:47,260 --> 00:43:48,860
with your dad backing you up,

676
00:43:48,920 --> 00:43:49,780
Yu Changxuan will definitely

677
00:43:49,780 --> 00:43:50,980
change his mind.

678
00:43:55,570 --> 00:43:56,630
It's pointless.

679
00:43:58,460 --> 00:44:00,380
He's made up his mind.

680
00:44:01,960 --> 00:44:03,900
No one can change it.

681
00:44:06,460 --> 00:44:07,650
He has already

682
00:44:10,400 --> 00:44:12,280
fallen for Ye Pingjun.

683
00:44:13,380 --> 00:44:14,570
Who is Ye Pingjun?

684
00:44:16,610 --> 00:44:17,820
The girl who injured

685
00:44:17,820 --> 00:44:19,110
Ziyi's face last time.

686
00:44:22,970 --> 00:44:24,940
It's her again!

687
00:44:37,070 --> 00:44:37,880
Pingjun!

688
00:44:38,670 --> 00:44:39,920
Take out those sweaters from my closet

689
00:44:39,920 --> 00:44:41,610
that I don't usually wear.

690
00:44:41,780 --> 00:44:42,820
It's sunny today.

691
00:44:42,940 --> 00:44:46,140
I want to air them out in the sun,
so they'll be warm to wear.

692
00:44:47,440 --> 00:44:48,010
Pingjun?

693
00:44:49,730 --> 00:44:50,530
Pingjun!

694
00:44:51,380 --> 00:44:51,980
Mom!

695
00:44:53,670 --> 00:44:54,550
On my way.

696
00:45:16,670 --> 00:45:18,170
Isn't this

697
00:45:19,070 --> 00:45:21,530
the sachet
where Mom keeps her jade pendant?

698
00:45:32,800 --> 00:45:33,590
Mom.

699
00:45:34,280 --> 00:45:35,870
We used to have a jade pendant

700
00:45:35,870 --> 00:45:37,550
with a bamboo leaf pattern carved on it.

701
00:45:37,550 --> 00:45:38,610
Do you remember it?

702
00:45:42,280 --> 00:45:43,440
You mean that one?

703
00:45:44,150 --> 00:45:45,860
Two years ago, our roof was leaking,

704
00:45:45,860 --> 00:45:46,940
and I pawned it

705
00:45:47,530 --> 00:45:48,480
to fix the roof.

706
00:46:08,410 --> 00:46:12,830
[Hall of Heavenly Kings]

707
00:46:16,780 --> 00:46:18,040
Fifth Young Master Yu,

708
00:46:18,710 --> 00:46:20,040
obsession is like fire.

709
00:46:20,980 --> 00:46:21,980
Only by letting go

710
00:46:22,360 --> 00:46:23,550
can one find peace.

711
00:46:26,880 --> 00:46:28,070
Without this light,

712
00:46:30,760 --> 00:46:32,710
the road ahead would be too cold.

713
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:38,800
There are quite a few people here
to pray today.

714
00:46:38,800 --> 00:46:39,480
Yeah,

715
00:46:40,130 --> 00:46:43,260
Fifth Young Master Yu,
you've graced our temple so much.

716
00:46:43,380 --> 00:46:45,560
It is truly a blessing for us.

717
00:46:49,050 --> 00:46:49,570
Please.

718
00:47:06,590 --> 00:47:09,820
[Prayer]

719
00:47:19,790 --> 00:47:25,330
[Prayer]

720
00:47:35,980 --> 00:47:37,380
The body returns to dust,

721
00:47:39,340 --> 00:47:40,900
but true love never fades.

722
00:47:55,280 --> 00:47:58,980
Thank you, Bodhisattva, for blessing
his safe return from the battlefield.

723
00:47:58,980 --> 00:48:00,000
Otherwise,

724
00:48:00,980 --> 00:48:02,130
I would never have the chance

725
00:48:02,130 --> 00:48:03,390
to thank him in person.

726
00:48:04,320 --> 00:48:07,340
I have come again specifically
to express my gratitude.

727
00:48:07,340 --> 00:48:09,740
May we both find peace from now on.

728
00:48:10,860 --> 00:48:12,590
May everything go well for him.

729
00:48:20,110 --> 00:48:20,730
Abbot,

730
00:48:21,850 --> 00:48:24,130
where did
these prayer sachets come from?

731
00:48:24,130 --> 00:48:25,780
They're from the worshippers who have made

732
00:48:25,780 --> 00:48:27,710
oil offerings over the past month.

733
00:48:30,540 --> 00:48:31,640
I want to see the list.
